<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.8.2">
<l>piṟappakattē māṇṭoḻinta piḷḷaikaḷai nālvaraiyu</l>
<l>miṟaippoḻutil koṇarntukoṭut toruppaṭuttavu ṟaippaṉūr</l>
<l>maṟaipperuntī vaḷarttiruppār varuviruntai yaḷittiruppār</l>
<l>ciṟappuṭaiya maṟaiyavarvāḻ tiruvaraṅka meṉpatuvē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>The city where dwells he who retrieved</l>
<l>and immediately reunited the four children</l>
<l>who had died in the birthing room</l>
<l>is called holy Araṅkam, where live eminent men of the Vedas</l>
<l rend="indent">who maintain the great Vedic fire</l>
<l rend="indent">and are gracious to guests.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
